Make the log functions in LogAndroid.cpp no-ops

This suppresses log statements and avoids the liblog dependency
(<log/log.h>, <async_safe/log.h>) that upstream libunwindstack has.
Log::Fatal() (upstream 838034d) keeps only its abort(), as Log.h
declares it [[noreturn]].

Chromium commits 53d2d81 (#if 0 the bodies) and 8d71305 (empty bodies,
includes deleted) in libunwindstack.git.

